      "created_at": "2019-06-14T19:28:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-06-14T19:28:38Z",
      "body": "The use case provided is not really supporting implementing this feature, but instead, pointing out that there may be a problem with the \"forgot my password\" functionality.\r\n\r\nAs @nickbe pointed out, I don't think Opensupports should easily allow admins to change user passwords, the admin will be able to do it anyways, but Opensupports shouldn't encourage it.\r\n\r\nThe real fix to this issue is to make sure that the \"forgot my password\" functionality works as expected, so I will be closing this issue, but any issue related to the password recovery system not working will be more than welcome.",
